; POOL EXTENSION (sl-0200): Pulse Cross — grade 4, comet pool.
; PLACEHOLDER descriptive id (fish re-skin later; identity
; data-keyed). ROOM-PATTERN family (sl-0188): ANCHOR, FOUR-PHASE
; flagship (the 2-4 recipe's ceiling, like its lattice sibling) —
; the lighthouse cross sweeps alone, then with spray, then DOUBLES
; (two emitters of the one pattern at staggered ticks lace a
; checker — rotor angle is a pure function of the fire tick), then
; everything compresses. hp 645 = 50s at the g4 spine (20-60s
; INTENSE; GATE 7). One lead per pattern; every number [T].

